OL,3,GNEWSAFour children and two adults in
OL,4,Ahospital after car mounts pavement
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour school children were among six
OL,7,Fpedestrians injured when a car mounted
OL,8,Fa pavement in Glasgow.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said a 34-year-old
OL,11,Fwoman and a 23-year-old man suffered
OL,12,Fserious injuries on Hyndland Road, in
OL,13,Fthe west end of the city, at about
OL,14,F15:45 on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe car, which was driven by a
OL,17,F29-year-old man, hit a bus stop and
OL,18,Fscaffolding before coming to a halt.
OL,20,FOfficers said a 13-year-old boy, two
OL,21,F13-year-old girls and another girl, 12,
OL,22,Fwere in a stable condition.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
